            "dimension": "adherence",
            "severity": "MED",
            "location": "packages/project-memory/src/index.ts",
            "message": "index.ts declares its own `interface MemoryFactory` (entity 841094) distinct from the `MemoryFactory` interface already owned by sc1/sc2 in types.ts (entity 840897). The LLD specifies sc1/sc2 as ONE versioned public type model owned by this Story, with 'Public signature names follow the HLD; pure import and supplied-resource ownership are preserved' — the public entry should re-export/import the single types.ts-defined MemoryFactory, not redeclare a second interface of the same name. If the two declarations diverge (e.g. index.ts's version omitting or changing the `open` signature), consumers importing from the package root vs internal modules could observe incompatible shapes, undermining the single-source-of-truth contract for sc1.",
